version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/izynu/ochrelle"
abstract: >-
  Ochrelle is an open-source ecosystem of Agent Skills for design intelligence:
  a master skill for style selection plus 27 specialist skills spanning visual
  styles, layout patterns, period aesthetics, and thematic genres (from
  skeuomorphism and minimalism to vaporwave and futuristic HUD) with WCAG 2.2 AA
  guidance for AI agents.
keywords:
  - design
  - agent-skills
  - ui
  - ux
  - design-systems
